      "content": "Thanks, James—I've found your account and the order on file.\n\n**Order:** `#W5362037`  \n**Current status:** `processed` (not yet eligible for an exchange/return in our system)  \n**Items in the order:**  \n- Bookshelf — $537.01  \n- Pet Bed — $204.09  \n**Total paid:** $741.10 (paid with gift card)\n\n### About switching a bookshelf to a camera\nIn this chat, **exchanges are only allowed within the same product type** (e.g., bookshelf → another bookshelf option).  \nSo **bookshelf → camera** can’t be done as a direct exchange here.\n\n### Next step options\n1) **Wait until the order is “delivered”** and then you can **return the bookshelf** (refund) so you can place a new order for the camera.  \n2) If you prefer, once delivered, you can also **exchange the bookshelf for another bookshelf option** (only within bookshelf options).\n\nHowever, right now your order is **still “processed,”** so I can’t start a return/exchange yet.\n\n**What would you like to do once it’s delivered?**  \nA) Return the bookshelf (for a refund)  \nB) Exchange the bookshelf for another bookshelf option",
